Package: tidytracks
Title: Functions to Analyse Tracking Data
Version: 0.2.1.9004
Authors@R: c(
    person("Lizzie", "Pearmain", role = c("aut")),
    person("Paul","Whitelaw", role = c("aut")),
    person("Holly", "Pickett", role = c("aut")),
    person("Andrea", "Manica", , "am315@cam.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description: A grammar for animal tracking data analysis based on
    'move2' objects. The package provides a consistent and expressive set
    of tools for manipulating tracks and associated metadata, allowing
    common movement-ecology workflows to be combined into clear and
    reproducible analyses. Functionality includes location filtering,
    trip segmentation, summary statistics, home range estimation and
    visualisation. Built on the 'sf' spatial framework, it integrates
    naturally with the tidyverse ecosystem.
